# Code Owners for Organization Repositories
# This file defines who owns what code and who should review changes
# Format: path pattern @owner1 @owner2

# Global owners (fallback for all files)
* @Nobodyworld/agents-platform @Nobodyworld/maintainers

# Repository-specific for dev-agent-switchboard ownership can be added below
# Examples:
# /src/ @Nobodyworld/frontend-team
# /backend/ @Nobodyworld/backend-team
# /tests/ @Nobodyworld/qa-team
# /docs/ @Nobodyworld/docs-team

# Security-critical files
*.pem @Nobodyworld/security-team
*.key @Nobodyworld/security-team
*secret* @Nobodyworld/security-team
*.env* @Nobodyworld/security-team

# CI/CD files
.github/workflows/ @Nobodyworld/devops-team
.github/actions/ @Nobodyworld/devops-team

# Package management files
package.json @Nobodyworld/frontend-team
requirements.txt @Nobodyworld/backend-team
pyproject.toml @Nobodyworld/backend-team
Cargo.toml @Nobodyworld/rust-team
go.mod @Nobodyworld/go-team